# navigation/

React Navigation wiring for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`RootNavigator.tsx`](RootNavigator.tsx) | Top-level stack. Adds new screens here as the app grows. |
| [`types.ts`](types.ts) | Type-level param lists for each navigator. |

## Conventions

- One file per navigator. Nested navigators get their own file (e.g.
  `TabsNavigator.tsx`).
- Param lists live in `types.ts` and are referenced via
  `NativeStackScreenProps<RootStackParamList, 'Home'>` in screen components.
- Never import screen-internal types here — the navigator only knows the
  screen component and its route params.

